libflipperpb: the stock Flipper Zero RPC protobuf (issue #388, spec R15.5).

proto/   flipperdevices/flipperzero-protobuf at tag 0.25 (commit
         1c84fa4891, the one stock firmware 1.3.4 uses), unchanged,
         with its .options and Changelog.  GPLv3 like the stock firmware.
gen/     generated by nanopb 0.4.9.1 (flipper/tools/mkflipperpb.sh);
         committed, so a build needs no Python protobuf.
version.h  the protobuf version the RPC answers in protobuf_version
         (FPB_MAJOR.FPB_MINOR = 0.25, the top of proto/Changelog).

To move to a newer stock protobuf: copy its files into proto/, run
flipper/tools/mkflipperpb.sh, update version.h and the golden frames in
flipper/tests/flipperpb if the encoding of a message changed.
